{"text": "Jemima Puddle duck was a farm duck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she was very annoyed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The farmers wife would not let her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hatch her own eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her sister in law, Rebeccah. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was happy to leave the hatching. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To others. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not have the patience. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To sit on a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For twenty eight days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rebeccah said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Neither do you, Jemima. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And you would let them go cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I want to hatch my own eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All by myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Jemima. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She tried to hide her eggs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But someone always found them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And carried them off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So she decided. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To make a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Far away from the farm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One fine spring afternoon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She set off. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Along the road over the hill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was wearing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A shawl and a bonnet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She ran down the hill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Flapping her shawl. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then she flew into the air.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "P", "u", "d", "d", "l", "e", " ", "d", "u", "c", "k", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "f", "a", "r", "m", " ", "d", "u", "c", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "a", "n", "n", "o", "y", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", 